      "the_angle_of_the_waggle_run_relative_t": "The angle of the waggle run relative to vertical = the angle of the food source relative to the sun. Straight up = toward the sun. 60° right = 60° right of the sun. The bee uses the sun as a compass and gravity as a reference.",
