      "moderate_persistence": "Moderate persistence",
      "modern_ethical_practice_has_shifted_cl": "Modern ethical practice has shifted: client assent (not just guardian consent) is required throughout sessions, \"normalization\" goals are increasingly declined, stimming is recognized as self-regulation rather than a target for reduction, and client-chosen goals replace clinician-imposed ones. The acronym stays; the values inside it have moved.",
