      "score_80": "Score 80%+",
      "seclusion_involuntary_confinement_of_a": "Seclusion = involuntary confinement of a student alone in a room or area from which the student is physically prevented from leaving. The \"physically prevented from leaving\" part is what makes it seclusion legally.",
