      "one_piece_of_metal_type_about_the_size": "One piece of metal type, about the size of a fingernail, is more engineered than it looks. Every named part exists for a reason: alignment, stacking, picking up by feel, even running ink. Before designing the alloy, look at what you are casting.",
      "online_used_books": "Online used books",
