      "freestyle_front_crawl": "Freestyle (Front Crawl)",
      "freestyle_inverted_same_long_axis_rota": "Freestyle inverted — same long-axis rotation, alternating arms, flutter kick. The single most important detail: head position. A neutral head with ears in the water and eyes up keeps the hips up and the body streamlined. Looking down sinks the hips and doubles drag.",
