      "45_fixed_pipe_is_automatically_qualifi": " (45° fixed pipe) is automatically qualified for all easier positions. The reverse is not true.",
      "46_multiple_choice_visual_inspection_o": "46 multiple choice. Visual inspection of weld samples — identify defects, measure dimensions, apply acceptance criteria. Uses physical weld coupons in the test room. Inspector applies code criteria to actual welds.",
      "4_coil_impedance_change_is_displayed_o": "4. Coil impedance change is displayed on instrument; operator interprets.",
      "4_crt_screen_or_now_lcd_shows_time_of_": "4. CRT screen (or now LCD) shows time-of-flight + amplitude. Skilled operator interprets.",
      "4_data_logged_for_every_weld_current_v": "4. Data logged for every weld — current, voltage, travel speed, time, position. Critical for traceability in regulated industries.",
      "4_for_part_b_get_hands_on_with_weld_sa": "4. For Part B: get hands-on with weld samples + practice applying acceptance criteria. Some local AWS sections offer practice clinics.",
      "4_general_room_ventilation": "4. General room ventilation: ",
