      "gamma_isotope": "Gamma (isotope): ",
      "garage_bay_rent_or_own_24x24_ft_minimu": "Garage bay (rent or own). 24x24 ft minimum for production work. Concrete floor (NOT wood). Adequate electrical (50A 240V minimum, 100A better). Ventilation. Some welders work outdoors May-Oct + heated bay rest of year.",
      "gas_bubbles_in_bead": "gas bubbles in bead",
      "gas_shielded_fcaw_smooth_bead_low_spat": "Gas-shielded FCAW. Smooth bead, low spatter, slag covers bead for protection while cooling. Best for: indoor production welding on plate. Faster than solid MIG.",
