      "inspector_teacher_mentor_roles": "Inspector, teacher, mentor roles",
      "inspector_training_click_to_identify": "Inspector training — click to identify",
      "intermediate_cooling_rate_acicular_str": "Intermediate cooling rate. Acicular structure. Stronger than pearlite, tougher than martensite.",
      "international_association_of_machinist": "International Association of Machinists Local S6. Largest single private-sector union local in Maine.",
